   "text": "Also: The best 85-inch TVs you can buy\nGenerally speaking, Samsung has more options for 8K-resolution TVs than LG, especially when it comes to choosing the panel with the best and most versatile picture for different areas, either dimly lit or bright. While LG has a decent, more budget-friendly 8K option in the QNED MiniLED 99 Series, the picture quality of Samsung’s QN900D TVs exceeds the former,",
